WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.290
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.790
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.630
It's my day!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.200
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.610
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.390
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.170
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.310
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.810
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.950
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.020
I just want to walk

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.530
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.440
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.880
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.150
It's my day!

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.150
Mom! What's this all about?

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:53.450
Shigeru, you keep your mouth shut.

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:58.260
As you can see, she's a tomboy,
but I put her in your hands.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.160
I'll kill her!

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:01.700
<i>K-kill...?</i>

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:03.000
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.970
It's not a joke!
Think I'll let you determine my life?

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:13.210
He's right! I'm only 18.
Why do I need a fianc・

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.810
My, you're birds of a feather...

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:21.520
It seems that's what they all say,
at the beginning.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.680
That's true.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:26.650
The wedding won't be until
they graduate from college, so...

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.820
Hey, just a minute!

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:30.090
They have four years
to get to know each other.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:31.790
Listen, you old bag...
You can't tell me...!

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.590
We'll leave that up to them.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.660
Don't be ridiculous! Fianc馥?!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:42.670
I'm terribly sorry it took us so long.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:47.070
Not at all. It's nice to see you again,
Mrs. Okawahara.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:50.310
I'm sorry I haven't been in touch.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.080
"I Will Tame You!!"

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.080
Oh, so, this is Tsukasa?

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:55.380
Oh, yes.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.120
He's so ignorant of the real world...

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.750
We'll be indebted to you...

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.420
Likewise, we'll be indebted to you...

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.330
Really, he's so ignorant
of the real world...

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.040
Oh... Who is this?

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.940
Uh... well...

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:31.250
Miss Makino...

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:40.290
Thank you very much 
for coming here today.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.770
Do you see, now, how things stand?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.000
Yes...

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.740
Do you? You're a bright person...

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:03.980
You will surely meet a boy
who's right for you.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:10.390
Mrs. Okawahara, we have a table
ready for us. Right this way...

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.960
Thank you very much.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.500
I've got to go back.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.830
<i>Yuki's waiting for me at work.</i>

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:30.240
<i>That's right, it's payday today.
I'll buy Mom and Dad something...</i>

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:33.310
<i>But, my legs won't move...</i>

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.880
<i>Do you? You're a bright person...</i>

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:43.090
<i>You will surely meet a boy
who's right for you.</i>

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.200
Calm down, Master Tsukasa...

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.430
Let go of me!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.430
Master! Madame, Master is...

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:11.850
Let's get outta here.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:40.870
<i>You will surely meet a boy
who's right for you.</i>

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.680
<i>She's right. The witch is right.</i>

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.990
We should be safe here.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:01.360
Damn! Why am I dressed
like it's New Year's?

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.970
Sorry I wasn't able
to figure out her scheme.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.970
But let me say this. I...

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:13.640
Huh?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:45.040
What are you doing?!

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.810
"What are you...?"
That's what <i>I</i> want to know!

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:02.820
<i>What's with him...?</i>

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.260
What's with that guy?!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.130
<i>Let's get outta here.</i>

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.320
What's with that jerk?!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:47.060
<i>Running away hand-in-hand...
Acting surprised...</i>

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:52.840
<i>I'll bet he was already seeing her.</i>

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:05.350
What a waste it was to take him seriously.
I'm such a fool!

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.720
Come on, Tsukushi...
It must be a mistake.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:10.990
It is not!

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.760
I'm sorry...

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.430
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:29.700
It was like a scene in a movie.
They went running off together.

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:35.010
I was left there looking like a fool.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:42.880
Um... Tsukushi...
Are you sure you're not just in shock?

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:47.090
To find out he had a fianc馥.

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:18.450
Of course not!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:22.020
Why should I be in shock?

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:30.630
I went to settle things.
Now they're settled.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.530
This is great. I don't have to see
his face anymore.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:40.370
It's a relief!
But he gets me so mad!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.140
<i>It's not a shock...</i>

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:50.480
<i>But... I couldn't tell the witch
what I wanted to.</i>

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.690
<i>That's all that's eating at me.</i>

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.460
<i>That's all it is.</i>

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.480
Hey! Wait up, will you?

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.650
What's with this guy?

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:35.390
Listen!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.210
Lend me some money.

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:56.480
If I had any, I'd be in a taxi.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.670
Oh... I guess so.

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:18.070
Wait a minute! Let's think this over.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.570
Look. I'm barefoot.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:25.270
The soles of my feet are sliced
to ribbons!

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.480
This is all your fault
for dragging me out.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:32.980
Don't you feel bad?

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.620
No, I don't.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:49.060
What's with that guy?

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.110
What are you doing?
You want me to hit you?

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.110
- Quit it!
- No!

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:07.880
Get off!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:08.320
No!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:19.530
What're you doing? Hey! Hey!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:21.330
Get off!

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.530
Ouch!

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:36.710
Is your ear sensitive?

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.310
I'll murder you!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.650
Tsukasa Domyoji?

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:51.020
Interesting!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:35.130
Damn! I've caught a cold.

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:41.240
<i>I'm so mad! I won't feel better
'til I tell him off.</i>

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:50.880
This is fine. Let me off here.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.150
Are you sure, miss?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.150
I'll be fine.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:14.270
So this is the place?

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:46.200
Well, congratulations on
your engagement.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:51.740
E-engagement?

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:52.970
Whose?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.680
How dare you make a fool of me!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:08.090
You saw everything.
Do you really think I knew about it?

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.630
My old lady did it all herself.

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.460
Hmm... Is that so?

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:18.170
Is that why you two love-birds
left hand in hand?

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.840
T-that was a mistake!

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.380
Hey, what's she talking about?

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.010
How could you mistake us?

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.150
Our hairstyles and clothing were
completely different!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.420
Are you blind?!

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.420
You don't understand a thing!

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:45.390
I called to explain yesterday,
but you didn't answer, did you?

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.930
I don't remember any calls.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.430
Don't take me lightly!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:55.800
I don't appreciate being used as a
plaything before your marriage!

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:58.470
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.820
That woman...

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:47.850
<i>It all happened like a whirlwind.
I can't really remember her face...</i>

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.290
<i>...but I think she was pretty.</i>

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:57.130
<i>She must be from
a really good family.</i>

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:03.600
<i>I guess it's for the best.</i>

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:06.100
<i>I was about to break it off
with him, anyway.</i>

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:13.440
<i>Tsukushi... Are you sure 
you're not just in shock?</i>

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:22.350
<i>Humph! No way! I'm just mad
about being treated like a bug.</i>

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:47.540
<i>Yes... She looked just like this.</i>

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.890
The Okawahara Family?
That's as classy as you can get!

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:04.230
Aren't they one of Japan's greatest
family concerns?

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:07.360
Don't they have ties to
a major American oil firm?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.030
That's the Domyoji family for you.
They go after the best.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.640
Oil is one sector that's missing
from the Domyoji Zaibatsu.

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:18.640
Leave it to my old lady
to solve that problem.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:22.480
Marry her son into that family
to expand her business?

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:25.380
Your mother's just as scary as ever.

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:35.120
You were at the Maple yesterday,
weren't you?

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:40.360
So, you're a student at Eitoku?
May I sit next to you?

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.960
<i>What's she doing here?</i>

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.600
Oh, please do.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:49.470
Eitoku has a huge campus.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.180
This is a lovely patio.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:02.180
If you're here to see Domyoji,
he's in the cafeteria.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.620
Oh? I'll stop by and see him later.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:10.490
I was wondering what sort of school
that weird guy attended...

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.990
It was on my way,
so I had my driver drop me off.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:19.160
Weird?

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.630
Don't you think he's weird?

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.400
I do... I truly do.

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:25.770
Isn't he, 'tho?

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:28.070
He was awful, yesterday!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.640
I was barefoot, you know.
And I didn't have any money.

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.150
Would you leave someone like that
high and dry?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.180
High and dry?

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:37.220
Yes!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:41.290
My feet were cut to shreds!
It took me an hour to walk home.

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:44.860
<i>Weird!</i>

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.490
I wanted to give him
a piece of my mind.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:50.960
<i>This is weird...</i>

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:57.570
But... you and he have been dating,
haven't you?

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:02.870
Why? Do people usually date
when they first meet?

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.540
First meet...?

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.280
B-but you two ran out together!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.210
Yeah... I don't know what that
was all about.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.650
Maybe he fell in love at first sight!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.860
<i>I'm beginning to boil again...
Damn him!</i>

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.070
Hey, look!

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:32.070
Tsukasa! There's Makino.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:43.750
You monkey!
What are you doing here?

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:49.150
Monkey?! How dare you!
Thanks to you, I'm sore all over.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:50.790
Who cares?

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:55.520
Let me make this clear...
I'm not agreeing to any engagement!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:01.060
Yeah, right... You're so naive.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:01.900
What?!

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:09.570
When I bit his ear yesterday,
he turned bright red!

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:11.840
Bit his ear?

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:13.910
Bit his ear?

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:16.980
You...!

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.250
Damn you!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.320
As your fianc馥...

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.890
I'll tame you!

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:04.980
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:09.730
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:19.200
Some day, the whole world

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:25.010
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:32.760
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:38.380
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:45.000
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:51.400
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:58.300
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:58.300 --> 00:23:07.180
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:15.090
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:21.150
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:28.410
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:31.800
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:37.670
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:48.060 --> 00:23:50.660
Shigeru Okawahara... Just who is she?

00:23:50.890 --> 00:23:52.400
She wants me
to have tea with her.

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:55.530
Seems she wants to learn
all about Domyoji.

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:58.470
But why ask me?
I don't want to be involved in this!

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:02.670
And why do I end up agreeing
to help her?

00:24:02.970 --> 00:24:04.470
This isn't good.

00:24:05.010 --> 00:24:07.580
Hana Yori Dango:
"Love Triangle from Hell!"

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:09.810
Leave me out of this!
